# Docker does not read .gitignore.
#
# The build stage here does `COPY . .`, which pulled .env.local - and the
# stray .env.local.bak beside it - into the builder. The runner stage only
# copies .next/standalone, .next/static and public, so they did not reach the
# published image, but a secret in any layer of any stage is a secret that
# has left the machine.
#
# The build gets its configuration from the ARGs the Dockerfile declares
# (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL, API_PROXY_URL), not from a file copied in, so nothing
# here is needed to build.

# Secrets, and the backup copies people leave next to them.
.env
.env.*

# Installed by `npm ci` in the deps stage.
node_modules
npm-debug.log*

# Built fresh inside the image.
.next
out

.git
.gitignore
*.log

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
